data: {"nodeProgressMessage":{"type":"NODE_EXECUTED","nodeCode":"RETURN_PICK","nodeName":"Return Pick","nodeType":"RETURN","nodeInput":"{\"returnValue\":\"The supplier **Example Supplies GmbH** (tax registration DE000000000) on invoice **INV-0001** could not be matched automatically to a Fusion supplier.\\n\\nNo candidate supplier has a TaxRegistrationNumber or TaxpayerId matching the invoice's DE000000000, and no candidate name matches the invoice's supplier name after normalization.\\n\\nSearch for the supplier below, or cancel the invoice. The search runs over the suppliers of the invoice's business unit and shows up to 25 matches per page; pick one to continue with that supplier.\\n\\n```json\\n{\\\"id\\\":\\\"supplierPick\\\",\\\"fields\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"supplier\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"select\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Supplier\\\",\\\"required\\\":true},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"invoiceNumber\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"hidden\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"INV-0001\\\"}],\\\"buttons\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"select\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Use this supplier\\\",\\\"variant\\\":\\\"callToAction\\\",\\\"data\\\":{\\\"decision\\\":\\\"SELECT\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"cancel\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Cancel\\\",\\\"variant\\\":\\\"outlined\\\",\\\"validate\\\":false,\\\"data\\\":{\\\"decision\\\":\\\"CANCEL\\\"},\\\"confirm\\\":\\\"Cancel this invoice?\\\"}]}\\n```\\n\\nEnd of the reply: the last line of the RETURN value.\"}","nodeOutput":"The supplier **Example Supplies GmbH** (tax registration DE000000000) on invoice **INV-0001** could not be matched automatically to a Fusion supplier.\n\nNo candidate supplier has a TaxRegistrationNumber or TaxpayerId matching the invoice's DE000000000, and no candidate name matches the invoice's supplier name after normalization.\n\nSearch for the supplier below, or cancel the invoice. The search runs over the suppliers of the invoice's business unit and shows up to 25 matches per page; pick one to continue with that supplier.\n\n```json\n{\"id\":\"supplierPick\",\"fields